                                "sense_id": "7ed5a1a1-f15f-3aef-8d31-f74f0feb0403",
                                "text": "The nightmare on the shucks experienced by young Bayard becomes, in Sanctuary, exponentially more deranging."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3693d87b-0dbb-4456-a423-af5ebe2d9239",
                                "sense_id": "7ed5a1a1-f15f-3aef-8d31-f74f0feb0403",
                                "text": "Over-communication can be more deranging than cannabis ..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6e7f95c2-09e4-410a-b796-48a2a67f4aa3",
                                "sense_id": "7ed5a1a1-f15f-3aef-8d31-f74f0feb0403",
                                "text": "I had never taken a drug more deranging than aspirin and the milder antibiotics."
                            }
                        ]
